                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 65.</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Hall</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-04-01"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 1,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Hall is informed that he has previously been authorized to offer the good
                    offices of the United States in the interest of peace and to avert a
                    conflict.</p>
            </div>
